sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as 구직자<br/>(APPLICANT)
    participant FE as Frontend<br/>(React)
    participant CTL as JobPostController
    participant SVC as JobPostService
    participant RNK as JobPostRankingService
    participant DB as DB<br/>(JobPost/Application/Resume/Career/Like)
    participant PUB as ApplicationEventPublisher
    participant LIS as InteractionEventListener<br/>(@Async eventsExecutor)
    participant LOG as ImpressionLog / ClickLog

    U->>FE: 공고 목록 페이지 진입 (추천 정렬 선택)
    FE->>CTL: GET /api/v1/job-posts?sortType=RECOMMENDED<br/>Authorization: Bearer <JWT>

    CTL->>CTL: requestId = UUID.randomUUID()
    CTL->>SVC: getJobPosts(filter, user, requestId)

    alt sortType == RECOMMENDED && user.role == APPLICANT
        SVC->>RNK: recommend(user, cursor, size)

        RNK->>DB: applicationRepository.findByApplicantUserId(userId)
        DB-->>RNK: 지원 이력 (HIRED / APPLIED / PENDING)
        RNK->>DB: resumeRepository.findByUserId + careerRepository.findByResumeId
        DB-->>RNK: 이력서·경력
        RNK->>DB: jobPostLikeRepository.findByUserId + resumeLikeRepository.findByResumeId
        DB-->>RNK: 좋아요/역방향 좋아요
        RNK->>RNK: UserSnapshot 구축<br/>(location, topCategory, hiredDates,<br/> likedEmployerIds, hiredEmployerIds, ...)

        RNK->>DB: findOpenPostsExcluding(hiredPostIds)
        DB-->>RNK: 후보 List<JobPost>

        RNK->>RNK: buildWageDistribution() — 카테고리별 시급 분포
        loop 각 후보 공고
            RNK->>RNK: scoreOne()<br/>지역(30) + 업종(20) + 일정(15)<br/>+ 급여백분위(15) + 신선도(10)<br/>+ 좋아요(5) + HIRED(5) − APPLIED(10)
        end
        RNK->>RNK: sort by score DESC, id DESC
        RNK->>RNK: page slice (offset = cursor, size+1 로 hasNext 판단)

        RNK-->>SVC: CursorPageResponse<JobPostCardResponse>
    else 그 외 정렬 (LATEST / DEADLINE / 비로그인)
        SVC->>DB: jobPostRepository.findByDynamicFilter(filter)
        DB-->>SVC: posts
        SVC->>SVC: liked 마킹 후 카드 DTO 변환
    end

    SVC->>PUB: publishEvent(ImpressionBatchEvent<br/>requestId, userId, sortType, positions[])
    SVC-->>CTL: response
    CTL-->>FE: 200 OK<br/>Headers: X-Request-Id, Cache-Control: no-store<br/>Body: 추천 카드 목록 + nextCursor
    FE-->>U: 추천 공고 카드 렌더

    Note over PUB,LOG: 이하 비동기 처리 — 사용자 응답을 막지 않음
    PUB-)LIS: onImpressionBatch(event)
    LIS->>LOG: impressionRepo.saveAll(JobPostImpressionLog × N)

    rect rgba(200,220,255,0.25)
        Note over U,LOG: ── 이후 카드 클릭 시 ──
        U->>FE: 추천 카드 클릭
        FE->>CTL: GET /api/v1/job-posts/{id}<br/>X-Request-Id, X-Referrer-Sort-Type=RECOMMENDED
        CTL->>SVC: getJobPost(id, user, requestId, referrerSortType)
        SVC->>DB: jobPostRepository.findById(id)
        DB-->>SVC: JobPost
        SVC->>PUB: publishEvent(ClickEvent)
        SVC-->>CTL: JobPostDetailResponse
        CTL-->>FE: 200 OK
        PUB-)LIS: onClick(event)
        LIS->>LOG: clickRepo.save(JobPostClickLog)
        Note over LOG: ImpressionLog × ClickLog 를 requestId 로 조인<br/>→ CTR / CVR / NDCG@10 산출 (매니저 대시보드)
    end
